atlas institutional-company-stress-gauntlet

architecture one-company-stress-gauntlet
  canonical_name OneCompanyStressGauntlet
  owns CompanyGauntletReplay
  consumes ExternalEvent
  consumes WorkState
  consumes CapabilityBid
  consumes FormatProfile
  consumes PartnerObservation
  consumes ModelRoute
  consumes Artifact
  consumes FrappeLineageCatalog
  consumes CanonicalContractIR
  publishes ReceiptEnvelope
  publishes ProofBundle
  family institutional
  domain Institutional / Cross-organ operating proof
  layer replay
  semantic_question Can one tiny company object cross Powers, Frappe, Model Commons, Format Commons and Partner Commons without collapsing their meanings?
  purpose Runs bounded customer-to-cash, artifact-supply, engineering-to-partner, knowledge-to-action and compiler-spine lanes over one semantic identity; the compiler-spine discovers all Frappe lineages from BonfyreFrappeCompiler, compiles their real schemas, and closes every local mutation through WorkGraph, authority/effect receipts and EvidenceGraph before replay.
  maturity measured
  node_types CompanySemanticObject
  node_types LaneReceipt
  node_types BoundedBlocker
  node_types ProofBundle
  node_types FrappeLineageCatalog
  node_types CanonicalContractIR
  edge_types projects_through
  edge_types converges_on
  internal_calculus shared-identity owner-trace replay across at least five owner families per lane
  internal_calculus format-native round-trip plus content-addressed semantic equivalence
  internal_calculus exact blocker preservation for unavailable lifecycle, storage, peer-transport, context and model routes
  internal_calculus catalog-derived lineage dependency graph plus idempotent WorkGraph effect replay
  invariant at least three lanes cross five or more distinct owner families over the same semantic object
  invariant every claimed Power invocation resolves through the live public-Power registry and carries an output digest
  invariant blocked organs remain named blockers and cannot contribute a success check
  invariant all reusable lane evidence converges on one tamper-evident ProofBundle digest
  invariant every registered Frappe lineage mutation has one WorkGraph obligation and one authority-bounded ReceiptEnvelope
  invariant ContextCompiler, UI and API projections bind the same canonical Frappe contract digest
  invariant replay and transactional rollback create no duplicate lineage effects, work or evidence relations
  forbidden_inference isolated simulation cash -> production revenue
  forbidden_inference local partner review -> remote partner completion, authority or mutation
  forbidden_inference unsigned DSSE envelope -> verified signature
  forbidden_inference byte equivalence -> producer, model, transport, authority or claim support
  forbidden_inference provider process identity -> AgentSession, WorkerRun or WorkGraph identity
  forbidden_inference source checkout or semantic proof -> live registered runtime binding
