  interacts frappe-core
  interacts helpdesk
  interacts erpnext
  interacts hrms
  interacts lms
  interacts wiki
  interacts drive
  interacts insights
  interacts money-graph
  interacts partner-commons
  interacts foreign-twin
  interacts work-graph
  interacts provider-graph
  interacts agent-session
  interacts artifact-graph
  interacts evidence-graph
