  source_lineage mesh external-chatgpt-20260821T0250-020
  source_lineage mesh external-chatgpt-20260821T0300-032

  known_gap every source this entry names is archived, so this is a historical measurement rather than a live implementation; no native replacement for the whole gauntlet is witnessed here

interaction one-company-gauntlet-projects-frappe
  source crm
  destination one-company-stress-gauntlet
  relation shared_object_doctype_projection
  preserves ActorGraph identity, occurrence identity, commitment identity, compiler-registered lineage identity and real DocType field/type grammar
  drops any implication that a projection owns actor, evidence, money or authority semantics
  forbidden_inference app record -> canonical identity, booked value, problem resolution or committed derived fact
  witness compiler_catalog_drives_receipted_cross_lineage_replay
  binding components/BonfyreControlPlane/company_stress_gauntlet.py

interaction one-company-gauntlet-binds-partner
  source partner-commons
  destination one-company-stress-gauntlet
  relation rights_limited_partner_review
  preserves partner identity, source reference, local observation and observe/reference rights
  drops remote mutation authority and any claim that local review changed the partner institution
  forbidden_inference local partner observation -> remote completion or authority
  witness foreign_twin_is_observe_reference_only
  binding components/BonfyreControlPlane/company_stress_gauntlet.py

interaction one-company-gauntlet-binds-model-session
  source agent-session
  destination one-company-stress-gauntlet
  relation provider_faithful_decision_receipt
  preserves stable AgentSession identity, provider/model identity, work node and evidence origin
  drops provider-native process identity as lifecycle identity
  forbidden_inference selected model route -> authority, quality, completion or lifecycle identity
  witness provider_process_id_is_not_lifecycle_identity
  binding components/BonfyreControlPlane/company_stress_gauntlet.py

interaction one-company-gauntlet-roundtrips-artifacts
  source artifact-graph
  destination one-company-stress-gauntlet
  relation format_profile_objectfabric_replay
  preserves concrete format identity, family, native validation, semantic equivalence, digest and ObjectFabric URI
  drops unavailable OpenDAL and Iroh carriers from the success frontier
  forbidden_inference common family substrate -> format equivalence or peer storage success
  witness six_registered_format_families_roundtrip
  binding components/BonfyreControlPlane/company_stress_gauntlet.py
